IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GROUPBRANCH.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 CALL-RESULT.
   05 RESULT-DETAIL.
      10 RESULT-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
   05 RESULT-CODE PIC XX.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL 'SYNTHETIC' USING BY REFERENCE CALL-RESULT
    END-CALL
    IF RESULT-AMOUNT >= 100.00
        DISPLAY 'HIGH'
    ELSE
        DISPLAY 'LOW'
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
